  "bodyHash": "1272bafda2f59be3",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個 Serilum 模組。用心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於本模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Configurable Mob Potion Effects 是一款伺服器端模組，允許管理員給予任何生物永久藥水效果，並設定當生物攻擊目標時對目標施加的藥水效果。它完全可自訂，支援所有模組新增的生物與藥水效果。預設情況下此模組不會執行任何動作，一切由你掌控。<br><br>共有兩個設定檔，皆位於資料夾 '<em>./config/configurablemobpotioneffects/</em>' 中。<br>其中一個名為 '<em>permanenteffects.txt</em>'，你可以在這裡為任何生物新增永久藥水效果。<br>另一個名為 'o<em>ndamageeffects.txt</em>'，你可以在這裡設定任何生物攻擊目標時應賦予目標的藥水效果。<br><br>設定檔會在首次載入模組時自動產生。若你新增了任何模組生物或藥水效果，請刪除這些檔案並重新啟動遊戲一次。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/customization-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含於 Serilum 的客製化套裝中\" width=\"416\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"運行環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/commands.svg\" alt=\"指令\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/cmpe reload</em> - 重新載入所有手動修改的設定檔內容。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可自訂設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">首次載入後，設定檔會包含所有可能的生物與藥水效果。等級設為 0 時，所有效果預設皆為停用。你只需要找到對應的行列並修改數值即可。</span><br><br>'<em>permanenteffects.txt</em>' 設定檔：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-mob-potion-effects/a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"167\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">'<em>ondamageeffects.txt</em>' 設定檔：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-mob-potion-effects/b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"214\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示範例\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">讓我們讓所有史萊姆變得超快，設定永久的速度等級 50。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>在 '<em>./config/configurablemobpotioneffects/permanenteffects.txt</em>' 中找到史萊姆區塊：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-mob-potion-effects/c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"126\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>找到速度藥水效果區段：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-mob-potion-effects/d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"125\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>將等級設為 50：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-mob-potion-effects/e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"125\"><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>重新啟動遊戲或輸入 <em>/cmpe reload</em>，然後觀看奇蹟發生：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-mob-potion-effects/f.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"560\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">另一個範例，讓我們讓末影螨的攻擊造成 1 秒的漂浮效果等級 10。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>在 '<em>./config/configurablemobpotioneffects/ondamageeffects.txt</em>' 中找到末影螨：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-mob-potion-effects/g.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1356\" height=\"189\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>找到漂浮效果區段：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-mob-potion-effects/h.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"156\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>將漂浮等級設為 10：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-mob-potion-effects/i.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"156\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>將持續時間設為 1 秒：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-mob-potion-effects/j.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"155\"><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>重新啟動遊戲或輸入 <em>/cmpe reload</em>，然後去擊敗那隻末影螨吧！</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-mob-potion-effects/k.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"564\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">最後一個範例，讓我們讓殭屍變得很快速，並在攻擊時使其目標中毒：</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>在 '<em>permanenteffects.txt</em>' 中找到殭屍，並將速度等級設為 5：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-mob-potion-effects/l.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"124\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>在 '<em>ondamageeffects.txt</em>' 中找到殭屍區塊，並將中毒等級設為 2，持續時間 5 秒即可：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-mob-potion-effects/m.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"154\"><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>重新啟動遊戲或輸入 <em>/cmpe reload</em> 就完成了！來看看這隻殭屍：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-mob-potion-effects/n.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>輪到你了！ :)</strong></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載來源仍位於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系內，你就可以在任何整合包中自由使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於評論區過於分散，我無法在各個模組頁面上逐一追蹤，因此已關閉留言功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 儲存庫</a> 進行回報。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
